Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\

Inword eXt attraction  must be matched by equ. 5.2.6 from TPOA

mass anglerMomemtum^2 sperationDistance = (eXt^2)/(4(r^2)) 

TPOA asigns h-bar/2 to the P superscript- (the electrostatic chare iin TPOA  \
pg 332)

Hear the eXt is assigned aome value related to Planks Constant, math should \
dictate the value along the way.

The value will be th e\[CloseCurlyQuote]base\[CloseCurlyQuote]value for \
Planks Constent; the energy-mass level of 1 haveing only the properity of \
Existance, working assumtion: it is a purely Complex value mathemamaitcally


\
\>", "Subsubsection",
